id: SCA-019
title: GitHub Actions ACTIONS_ALLOW_UNSECURE_COMMANDS enabled
category: supply-chain
severity: error
engine: pattern
target:
  extensions: .yml .yaml
  exclude_paths: test/ node_modules/ .git/ vendor/
  content_contains: ACTIONS_ALLOW_UNSECURE_COMMANDS
patterns:
  - regex: ACTIONS_ALLOW_UNSECURE_COMMANDS\s*:\s*true
    message: Re-enables deprecated set-env and add-path commands, allowing arbitrary environment manipulation by any workflow step.
fix: Remove ACTIONS_ALLOW_UNSECURE_COMMANDS. Use $GITHUB_ENV file approach instead. The deprecated commands were disabled for security reasons.
